{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00381",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 8.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Hi doctor, um, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.24,
      "end_seconds": 12.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.69,
      "end_seconds": 20.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "I'm here because of pain in my right shoulder. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.66,
      "end_seconds": 27.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.88,
      "end_seconds": 30.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I've had it since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.37,
      "end_seconds": 36.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.67,
      "end_seconds": 45.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I get some relief from rest. Honestly, a couple of times a week. About a five out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.05,
      "end_seconds": 48.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.65,
      "end_seconds": 65.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a click in the shoulder as well. Um, the click in the shoulder? That's been for five days. As for click in the shoulder, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.07,
      "end_seconds": 68.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "And neck pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No neck pain, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.22,
      "end_seconds": 76.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.44,
      "end_seconds": 79.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.8,
      "end_seconds": 82.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.56,
      "end_seconds": 87.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Just cataract surgery on my right eye, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.14,
      "end_seconds": 91.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.64,
      "end_seconds": 92.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.92,
      "end_seconds": 110.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.16,
      "end_seconds": 113.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.54,
      "end_seconds": 121.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.34,
      "end_seconds": 125.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.68,
      "end_seconds": 129.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 146.89,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.94,
      "end_seconds": 150.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.87,
      "end_seconds": 154.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.92,
      "end_seconds": 159.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.1,
      "end_seconds": 161.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.49,
      "end_seconds": 165.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.96,
      "end_seconds": 179.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Lifting the arm to the side is painful between sixty and a hundred twenty degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.38,
      "end_seconds": 182.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.41,
      "end_seconds": 196.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Neck movements are full and don't reproduce it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.03,
      "end_seconds": 214.62,
      "duration_seconds": 14.59,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with a rotator cuff problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.48,
      "end_seconds": 217.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.71,
      "end_seconds": 235.04,
      "duration_seconds": 16.33,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a rotator cuff problem, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your right shoulder, since Friday, and no neck pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.76,
      "end_seconds": 239.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Um, you know, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.31,
      "end_seconds": 262.14,
      "duration_seconds": 21.83,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ultrasound of the shoulder for shoulder pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm prescribing naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day after food, for five days. That's for shoulder pain. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Gentle pendulum exercises, I'll show you a couple, but nothing overhead for a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.98,
      "end_seconds": 276.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.58,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.88,
      "end_seconds": 279.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.05,
      "end_seconds": 288.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.96,
      "end_seconds": 297.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.91,
      "text": "So, I take the naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day after food and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.97,
      "end_seconds": 303.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.14,
      "end_seconds": 307.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.13,
      "end_seconds": 309.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}